OL,4,CTwo days as a tradwife               W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GDressed in an unfamiliar long skirt, W5
OL,7,GPoppy Jay is standing in a chicken   W5
OL,8,Gcoop faced with an angry cockerel as W5
OL,9,Gshe checks for eggs.                 W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GAs a director and writer, Jay is     W5
OL,12,Gnormally behind the camera, but      W5
OL,13,Gtoday she's in front of it, trying   W5
OL,14,Gout life as a tradwife.              W5
OL,15,                                      W5
OL,16,GThe Tradwife - short for traditional W5
OL,17,Gwife - movement sees women embracing W5
OL,18,Gtraditional gender roles in the      W5
OL,19,Ghome, such as cooking, cleaning and  W5
OL,20,Gchild rearing, while submitting to   W5
OL,21,Gtheir bread-winning husbands.        W5
